{"id": "u16", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "rom_pa", "difficulty": "medium", "hardest": false, "category": "translation", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 42, "out_tokens": 206, "cost_inr": 0.009837, "latency_ms": 1578.9, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 42, "out_tokens": 206, "reasoning_tokens": 73, "cost_inr": 0.009837, "latency_s": 1.579}], "reasoning_tokens": 73, "answer": "**Translation:** \"My account has been closed. Why? I used to deposit money every month.\"\n\n**Notes on the translation:**\n- \"Khata\" = account (bank account, in this context)\n- \"Band ho gaya\" = has been closed/shut\n- \"Paise paunda si\" — this phrase is in Punjabi (masculine form), meaning \"used to deposit/put money\"\n- \"Ta\" is a Punjabi emphatic particle, roughly adding emphasis like \"I *used to* deposit money every month (after all)\"\n\nThe customer seems confused and frustrated about their account being closed despite regular monthly deposits.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u17", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "pa", "difficulty": "easy", "hardest": false, "category": "translation", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 28, "out_tokens": 380, "cost_inr": 0.017478, "latency_ms": 2449.4, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 28, "out_tokens": 380, "reasoning_tokens": 174, "cost_inr": 0.017478, "latency_s": 2.449}], "reasoning_tokens": 174, "answer": "**Punjabi (Gurmukhi):**\n\nਤੁਹਾਡੀ ਲੋਨ ਦੀ ਈ.ਐੱਮ.ਆਈ. 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਨੂੰ ਜਮ੍ਹਾ ਕਰਨੀ ਹੈ।\n\n**Alternative version:**\n\nਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਲੋਨ ਦੀ ਈ.ਐੱਮ.ਆਈ. ਦੀ ਤਾਰੀਖ਼ 5 ਦਸੰਬਰ ਹੈ।\n\n**Transliteration:** Tuhāḍī lon dī ī.em.ā.ī 5 dasambar nū jamhā karnī hai.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
