{"id": "u19", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 66, "out_tokens": 136, "cost_inr": 0.007011, "latency_ms": 1128.4, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 66, "out_tokens": 136, "reasoning_tokens": 43, "cost_inr": 0.007011, "latency_s": 1.128}], "reasoning_tokens": 43, "answer": "**Option B, Rs 1,000 more.**\n\n**Calculation:**\n- Option A: 2,00,000 × 6.5% × 1 = Rs 13,000\n- Option B: 2,00,000 × 7% × 1 = Rs 14,000\n\nDifference: 14,000 − 13,000 = **Rs 1,000** (Option B earns more)", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u20", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "hi", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 124, "out_tokens": 212, "cost_inr": 0.011214, "latency_ms": 1413.9, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 124, "out_tokens": 212, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "cost_inr": 0.011214, "latency_s": 1.414}], "reasoning_tokens": 0, "answer": "# लोन तुलना\n\n**लोन A:**\n- मूलधन = ₹1,00,000\n- दर = 9%\n- अवधि = 1 साल\n- ब्याज = (1,00,000 × 9 × 1) / 100 = **₹9,000**\n\n**लोन B:**\n- मूलधन = ₹1,00,000\n- दर = 10.5%\n- अवधि = 1 साल\n- ब्याज = (1,00,000 × 10.5 × 1) / 100 = **₹10,500**\n\n**अंतर:** ₹10,500 − ₹9,000 = ₹1,500\n\n## ✅ उत्तर: लोन A, ₹1,500 सस्ता", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u21", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 59, "out_tokens": 349, "cost_inr": 0.016501, "latency_ms": 2113.4, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 59, "out_tokens": 349, "reasoning_tokens": 63, "cost_inr": 0.016501, "latency_s": 2.113}], "reasoning_tokens": 63, "answer": "## Option A: Simple Interest (7%)\n\n$$SI = \\frac{P \\times R \\times T}{100} = \\frac{1{,}00{,}000 \\times 7 \\times 2}{100} = ₹14{,}000$$\n\n## Option B: Compound Interest (6.8% yearly)\n\n$$A = P\\left(1 + \\frac{R}{100}\\right)^T = 1{,}00{,}000 \\times (1.068)^2$$\n\n$$A = 1{,}00{,}000 \\times 1.140624 = ₹1{,}14{,}062.40$$\n\n$$CI = 1{,}14{,}062.40 - 1{,}00{,}000 = ₹14{,}062.40$$\n\n## Comparison\n\n$$14{,}062.40 - 14{,}000 = ₹62.40$$\n\n**Option B (compounded at 6.8%) earns more interest — about ₹62 more** than Option A. \n\n*Intuition:* Although 6.8% < 7%, the compounding in the second year means interest is earned on the first year's interest as well, which just makes up the lower rate and edges ahead.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u22", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "pa", "difficulty": "hard", "hardest": false, "category": "reasoning", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 155, "out_tokens": 781, "cost_inr": 0.037237, "latency_ms": 4141.8, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 155, "out_tokens": 781, "reasoning_tokens": 480, "cost_inr": 0.037237, "latency_s": 4.142}], "reasoning_tokens": 480, "answer": "₹2,00,000 ਦਾ ਕਰਜ਼ਾ, 11% ਸਾਲਾਨਾ ਵਿਆਜ (ਮਾਸਿਕ ਦਰ ≈ 0.9167%), 36 ਕਿਸਤਾਂ ਲਈ:\n\n**EMI ਫਾਰਮੂਲਾ:**\nEMI = P × r × (1+r)ⁿ / [(1+r)ⁿ − 1]\n\n- P = 2,00,000\n- r = 0.11/12 ≈ 0.0091667\n- (1+r)³⁶ ≈ 1.3889\n\nEMI = 2,00,000 × 0.0091667 × 1.3889 / (1.3889 − 1)\nEMI ≈ 2,546 / 0.3889\n\n**ਕੁੱਲ ਭੁਗਤਾਨ:** 36 × EMI ≈ ₹2,35,720\n**ਕੁੱਲ ਵਿਆਜ:** ≈ ₹35,720\n\n**₹6,548**", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
