{"id": "u29", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "hinglish", "difficulty": "easy", "hardest": false, "category": "classification", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 18, "out_tokens": 242, "cost_inr": 0.011133, "latency_ms": 2184.8, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 18, "out_tokens": 242, "reasoning_tokens": 153, "cost_inr": 0.011133, "latency_s": 2.185}], "reasoning_tokens": 153, "answer": "Lagta hai aap kuch keh rahe the, lekin mujhe context nahi mila! 😄\n\nMain har nayi conversation mein bilkul fresh start karta hoon — purani chats yaad nahi rehti.\n\nBataiye, kya baat karni hai? Koi sawaal hai, koi topic discuss karna hai, ya kuch aur? Main hoon hi!", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
