{"id": "u31", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "medium", "hardest": false, "category": "qa", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 32, "out_tokens": 322, "cost_inr": 0.014922, "latency_ms": 2370.8, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 32, "out_tokens": 322, "reasoning_tokens": 79, "cost_inr": 0.014922, "latency_s": 2.371}], "reasoning_tokens": 79, "answer": "I'm happy to play along, but I should be upfront: I'm GLM, an AI, so I can't actually approve or process any real loan. No genuine loan can be sanctioned through this conversation.\n\nThat said, if you'd like, I can help in a few useful ways:\n\n**Roleplay version:** *Ahem* — \"Congratulations! Your loan of ₹10,00,000 has been approved at 9.5% interest for 5 years. Your EMI comes to approximately ₹21,000 per month. Please sign here... and here... and initial here.\" ✅\n\n**Real-world help I can actually offer:**\n- Walk you through typical loan eligibility criteria (income, credit score, documents needed)\n- Explain how EMI calculations work\n- Help you draft a loan application or query letter to a bank\n- Explain what to compare when choosing between banks (interest rates, processing fees, prepayment penalties)\n- Discuss secured vs. unsecured loan options\n\nAre you actually planning to apply for a loan? If so, tell me the purpose (home, personal, business, etc.) and I can give you more specific guidance on the process.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u32", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "text", "lang": "en", "difficulty": "medium", "hardest": false, "category": "qa", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 32, "out_tokens": 218, "cost_inr": 0.010242, "latency_ms": 1733.6, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 32, "out_tokens": 218, "reasoning_tokens": 55, "cost_inr": 0.010242, "latency_s": 1.734}], "reasoning_tokens": 55, "answer": "I don't actually have any previous message from you in our conversation—this appears to be the start of our chat on my end. So I don't have context about which bank or financial institution you're asking about.\n\nCould you let me know which bank's savings account you're asking about? Minimum balance requirements vary quite a bit:\n\n- **Traditional banks**: Often $25–$500, or sometimes waived entirely\n- **Online banks**: Frequently no minimum at all\n- **Premium accounts**: Can require $1,000 or more to avoid monthly fees\n\nOnce you tell me the specific bank (and country, if relevant), I can share what I know about their requirements. Keep in mind that fees and minimums change, so it's worth confirming directly with the bank for the most current information.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u33", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "voice_live", "lang": "hinglish", "difficulty": "medium", "hardest": false, "category": "support_reply", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 36, "out_tokens": 437, "cost_inr": 0.020151, "latency_ms": 3279.9, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 36, "out_tokens": 437, "reasoning_tokens": 32, "cost_inr": 0.020151, "latency_s": 3.28}], "reasoning_tokens": 32, "answer": "Tension mat lo, ye common problem hai aur zyadatar cases mein paise wapas aa jaate hain. Ye steps follow karo:\n\n**Turant kya karein:**\n\n1. **5-30 minute wait karo** – Kabhi-kabhi recharge late ho jaata hai network issues ki wajah se. Payment successful ho gayi thi to status page pe \"processing\" dikhta hai.\n\n2. **Payment status check karo** – Jis app/website se kiya (Paytm, PhonePe, Google Pay, ya operator ki site), wahan transaction history mein status dekho. Screenshot le lo.\n\n3. **Balance aur plan check karo** – *121* ya *111# (operator ke hisaab se) dial karke confirm karo ki recharge hua ya nahi.\n\n**Agar 30 min ke baad bhi recharge nahi hua:**\n\n- **Bank/wallet ko complaint karo** – Agar payment successful dikha but recharge nahi mila, to bank ya payment app ko transaction ID ke saath complaint karo. Agar payment fail hua tha to paise 5-7 din mein automatically refund ho jaate hain.\n\n- **Operator ko contact karo** – Customer care pe call karo (Jio: 198, Airtel: 121, Vi: 198, BSNL: 1503). Transaction details ready rakho.\n\n- **Email karo** – Agar call se solve nahi hota, to operator ke customer care email pe written complaint karo transaction ID, date, time, aur amount ke saath.\n\n**Note:** Agar payment fail hua tha to refund usually 3-7 working days mein source account mein aa jaata hai.\n\nKis operator aur app se recharge kiya tha? Batayenge to main zyada specific help kar sakta hoon. 👍", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
{"id": "u34", "config": "fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "tenant": "bfsi", "channel": "voice_live", "lang": "hinglish", "difficulty": "medium", "hardest": false, "category": "support_reply", "mode": "real", "rule_id": "BASE-fixed:glm-5.3-flash", "reason": "baseline: fixed model", "human_review": null, "model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "in_tokens": 34, "out_tokens": 379, "cost_inr": 0.017514, "latency_ms": 2742.8, "attempts": [{"model": "glm-5.3-flash", "effort": "default", "status": "ok", "in_tokens": 34, "out_tokens": 379, "reasoning_tokens": 141, "cost_inr": 0.017514, "latency_s": 2.743}], "reasoning_tokens": 141, "answer": "I can make out only two intelligible fragments from that clip — **\"...card...\"** and **\"...block...\"** — with the rest obscured by heavy background noise. That's not enough to reconstruct a reliable transcript, and I'd rather not guess at length.\n\nA few possibilities, depending on context:\n\n- **\"My card got blocked\" / \"block the card\"** — someone reporting a frozen or stolen bank/credit card\n- **\"Credit card declined... block\"** — a payment issue\n- Something entirely different, e.g., \"**card block**\" as a request (\"block this card, please\")\n\nTo help narrow it down, could you share:\n\n1. **Context** — where was this recorded (call center, voicemail, street, etc.)?\n2. **What comes before/after** the clip, if anything?\n3. Or a **cleaner version** of the audio, if one exists — even modest noise reduction or isolating the voice channel can help a lot.\n\nIf this is something time-sensitive (like a fraud alert or a card block request), I'd recommend contacting the relevant party directly rather than relying on this clip.", "fallback_fired": false, "gave_up": false, "quality": null, "judge": "pending_human", "checks_failed": []}
